data_alpha_quartz
# Wavenum example file. Alpha-quartz, space group P 32 2 1 (No. 154).
# Atom coordinates after Levien et al. (1980), Am. Mineral. 65, 920-930, written in the
# International Tables origin of P 32 2 1 so that the listed symmetry operations generate
# 3 Si + 6 O per cell (Si-O 1.60 A).
_chemical_name_mineral           'Quartz'
_chemical_formula_sum            'O2 Si'
_cell_length_a                   4.9137
_cell_length_b                   4.9137
_cell_length_c                   5.4047
_cell_angle_alpha                90.0
_cell_angle_beta                 90.0
_cell_angle_gamma                120.0
_space_group_name_H-M_alt        'P 32 2 1'
_space_group_IT_number           154
loop_
 _space_group_symop_operation_xyz
  'x, y, z'
  '-y, x-y, z+2/3'
  '-x+y, -x, z+1/3'
  'y, x, -z'
  'x-y, -y, -z+1/3'
  '-x, -x+y, -z+2/3'
loop_
 _atom_site_label
 _atom_site_type_symbol
 _atom_site_fract_x
 _atom_site_fract_y
 _atom_site_fract_z
 _atom_site_occupancy
  Si1  Si  0.46970  0.00000  0.66667  1.0000
  O1   O   0.41350  0.26690  0.78577  1.0000
